  "technical_and_design_decisions": [
    "Migration guide (U1) is delivered as Markdown/Asciidoctor source that feeds into the same reference guide pipeline as the rest of the XD docs.",
    "The Pig sample (U2) will be implemented as a 'pigjob' module type, consistent with existing XD processor/source/sink abstractions.",
